        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the veterinary surgeons and clinical staff, mentioning Dr Jonathan, Dr Natascha, and nurse Catherine for their expertise and kindness. Clients appreciate the reassuring manner displayed during stressful emergencies and routine consultations. While a few pet owners felt interactions regarding policy enforcement lacked empathy, the broad consensus highlights capable and attentive clinicians."
