        "en": "Dedicated care with policy concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Feedback regarding patient handling is largely favourable, with pet parents reporting gentle care for recovering cats and dogs undergoing surgery. However, several reviewers voice criticism regarding rigid corporate policies, such as mandatory six-month exams for repeat prescriptions that cause distress to nervous pets. Clients advise clarifying clinic protocols when registering anxious animals."
      }
    },
    {
