      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Emergency access with intake disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients value the practice's 24-hour emergency availability, noting that pets with acute trauma were promptly admitted on weekends and bank holidays. In contrast, critical reviews describe severe disappointment when clinic staff declined to examine a stray animal in distress brought by rescuers late at night. Pet owners appreciate fast triage during registered emergency appointments."
      }
    }
